学校宿管穿着TKA t-shirt 举着牌子，写有学生名字，会在学生去领取行李的途中逐个接到学生

column112:
We offer over 50 art classes. All student are required to take two art classes every term. 

Some examples:
Dance: Creative Dance, Jazz, Theater Dance, and Popular Dance Styles, Performing Dance Ensemble
Social Dance; 
Music: A Cappella Select Choir, Choir 9-10, Choir 11-12, Jazz Band, Orchestra, Performing Music Ensemble/House Band, Music Studio, Theatre Pit Orchestra;
Theatre Arts: Act Out! Film, Improv Like a Pro, Musical Theatre/Play Production Ensemble, Spoken Word, Stagecraft, Theatre as Communication (ESL 9);
Visual Arts: Advanced Photography, Animation, Beginning Drawing, Beginning Photography, Ceramics, Drawing II, Graphic Design, Mixed Media, New Media Art, Painting and Printmaking, Sculpture and Materials Exploration, Visual Storytelling and Publication, Watercolor and Related Media;

